adr: ADR-1453
evidence: RTX 4090, --precision max: four outputs of 262 of 262 frames (Netflix 576x324 at 8 to 16 bit and 4:2:2, 1080p checkerboards, Sparks 10 bit, BBB 4K 48 frames, noise at 8 to 16 bit and at 40x40 to 64x64, bright 16-bit 1080p, BBB 1080p and 4K widened to 16 bit) identical to --backend cpu; exact while the sum of squares is below 2^53 units of 2^-16 (every frame up to 2097152 pixels, every 8/10/12-bit frame), within (pixels - 2^21 + 1) / pixels * 2^(e - 69) + 2^-37 past it.
